OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as reserves used to fund
OL,4,Apension pot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former civil servant has told the BBC
OL,7,Fislanders are unaware of the "scale of
OL,8,Fcuts" to the Social Security Fund and
OL,9,FSocial Security Reserve Fund which pay
OL,10,Ftowards pensions and benefits.
OL,12,FAccountant Alisdair Macleod said the
OL,13,FStates' use of reserve funds to offset
OL,14,Fcuts "doesn't feel healthy".
OL,16,FThe Social Security Fund receives
OL,17,Fcontributions from islanders; their
OL,18,Femployers and the government pay a
OL,19,Fcontribution through the States Grant,
OL,20,Fthough this was paused from 2020-2023
OL,21,Fdue to finance pressures connected with
OL,22,Fthe Covid pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
